# Area G (G-5): revived. The dead German gate (in_spd_majority / SPD-chancellor
# checks, never true in Spanish play) is replaced with a live check for whether
# PSOE holds any of its three initial-cabinet portfolios - justice, labor, or
# finance (root.scene.dry's initial cabinet assignments) - which also stays true
# if PSOE later gains additional ministries.
view-if: psoe_in_government and (justice_minister_party == "PSOE" or labor_minister_party == "PSOE" or finance_minister_party == "PSOE")
on-arrival: last_cabinet_action = 1
new-page: true 

= Cabinet

With PSOE ministers holding key portfolios in the government, we can direct the affairs of the national government - even though the PSOE has never held the presidency of the Council of Ministers itself.

